<blockquote>
<p>SCP-XXXX instances manifestations occur a minimum of once every two hours, and a maximum of once every three days.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Typo on &quot;instances manifestations&quot;. I'd just cut &quot;instances&quot; wholesale, it's unnecessary.</p>
